~ start
Tie: By golly, could it be? Is that unobtainium?
- No, sir.
	Tie: Then what is it?
	- Coal Sir.
		Tie: ... Coal?
		- Yes sir. The same stuff you would use on your grill sir.
			Tie: I KNOW WHAT COAL IS.
			Tie: It can't be coal. We've come all this way. It has to be something more mysterious.
			Tie: It has to be something else. Go take another look.
			do get_node("/root/main/business_man/dialogue_box").starting_point="another_look"
			=> END
~ another_look
Tie: Is it still coal?
- Still coal sir.
	Tie: Okay when you say coal, you are just lying to my face right?
	- No sir.
		Tie: Just to make me feel better right?
		- No sir.
			Tie: Just because you happen to be sensitive to the fact that this expedition cost me my entire life savings right?
			- OUR life savings, sir.
				Tie: Ok. How much cash is this coal worth.
				- It might cover the trip back.
					Tie: ... I shouldn't have brought an accountant.
					do get_node("/root/main/business_man/dialogue_box").starting_point="stages"
					=> END
~ stages
Tie: So that's it then? At the center of everything is a block of coal?
Tie: No secrets to unravel, no purpose, just a big ball of coal?
- I've been bigger balls sir. This would be mid size.
	Tie: You used to moonlight as a therapist right?
	- Before the incident sir, yes.
		Tie: Help me work through this. What does this mean?
		- For our finances or your mental health?
			Tie: What does it mean? What does ANY of it mean?
			Tie: Is this the secret? 
			Tie: Am I supposed to interpret it like that one movie with the panda?
			- Sir, financially I don't think we have much room for interpretation.
				Tie: It been decades of work. I've lost two marriages for this.
				- Sir, the divorces were because your communication skills are terrible.
					Tie: They couldn't see my vision.
					- I'm afraid they might have been seeing clearly.
						Tie: ... Go back to talking about our money.
						- What money?
							Tie: That's fair. Unlike this.
							do get_node("/root/main/business_man/dialogue_box").starting_point="whatnext"
							=> END
~ whatnext
Tie: So what next? We climb out and then what?
- I'm assuming we run from our creditors sir.
	Tie: No task can match this one. There's no point to my life any more.
	- Maybe the real point is the lessons we learned along the-
		Tie: Do not finish that sentence.
		Tie: This is all I've ever wanted. For so long.
		- You did technically do it.
			Tie: I don't know how to live without this.
			- Maybe you shouldn't.
				Tie: Are you saying I should give up?
				- No, I'm saying you shouldn't try to 'know' how to live.
					Tie: What does that even mean?
					- Look at where it brought you.
						Tie: Look at where it brought US, you mean.
						Tie: ...
						do get_node("/root/main/ending_cutscene").play("ending")
=> END